      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Annealing at approximately 500 degrees Celsius will relieve residual stresses in the coating–substrate system.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Annealing at approximately 500 degrees Celsius will refine the coating–substrate interface.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The proposed low-temperature process will avoid formation of deleterious intermetallic compounds.",
